---
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { breadcrumbNode } from '../lib/schema';

const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { name: 'For professionals', href: '/professionals/' },
];
---

<Base
  title="For Designers and Hotels | Mr Wallcover"
  description="Specification support, room schedules and installation for interior designers, hotels and main-contractor packages in London."
  path="/professionals/"
  extraSchema={[breadcrumbNode(crumbs)]}
>
  <div class="container-page pb-20">
    <header class="page-head">
      <Breadcrumb items={crumbs} />
      <p class="eyebrow">For professionals</p>
      <h1>A package, not a consumer quiz.</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-5">Send the schedule, the drawings and what you already know. Unknowns can wait. There is no trade discount, partner level or promised reply time on this page.</p>
    </header>
    <section id="designers" class="border-t border-line py-12">
      <h2 class="m-0 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Designers and architects</h2>
      <p class="lede mt-4">Room schedules, drawings and a material specification are enough to start. Say who is supplying the material, which rooms are in the package, and any date the tender needs.</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-2">
        <li>Sample areas and mock-ups when the specification is still open.</li>
        <li>Batch checks when material is free-issue.</li>
        <li>Room-by-room progress, snagging, and the same aftercare as every hang.</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-solid-ink mt-6" href="/contact/?audience=designer&intent=source">Send a designer brief</a>
    </section>
    <section id="commercial" class="border-t border-line py-12">
      <h2 class="m-0 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)]">Hotels and commercial packages</h2>
      <p class="lede mt-4">Repeat rooms, access limits, a programme and a clear line on who supplies the material. We work alongside main contractors, and we can also take a package directly.</p>
      <p>Insurance, method statements and qualifications are issued current, and only when a live job needs them. A decorative finish is not a fire certificate.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-solid-ink mt-6" href="/contact/?audience=commercial&intent=install">Send a commercial brief</a>
    </section>
    <section class="border-t border-line py-12">
      <h2>Working with the studio</h2>
      <p>If you specify wallcoverings regularly and want a direct line for future packages, say so in the note. We will reply about the work in front of us. We do not publish a trade price list.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
